Third-party code in this engine:

- kernels/third_party/mlx: Metal kernel headers of MLX 0.32.3 (MIT, Copyright Apple Inc.),
  unchanged; see kernels/third_party/mlx/LICENSE.
- kernels/dec_*.metal, kernels/enc_*.metal: several kernels are ports of MLX 0.32.3 kernels
  (rms_norm, rope, sdpa_vector, quantized matmul, steel GEMM / addmm) so that the engine
  reproduces MLX's numerics (MIT, Copyright Apple Inc.).
- src/tokenizer.mm, src/prompt.cpp, src/text.cpp: ported from SGLang-Omni (Apache-2.0,
  Copyright the SGLang-Omni authors), sglang_omni_mlx/native/src/common/{tokenizer,text}.cpp and
  qwen3_asr/{qwen3_asr_transcriber,qwen3_audio}.cpp. The pre-tokenizer split uses
  NSRegularExpression (ICU) instead of pcre2; NFC normalization uses CoreFoundation.
